      "title_gu": "વ્યાયામ Q2",
      "question": "What is the meaning of the phrase 'Water, water, everywhere, nor any drop to drink'?",
      "question_hi": "'वाटर, वाटर, एवरीवेयर, नॉर एनी ड्रॉप टू ड्रिंक' (पानी, पानी हर जगह, पीने के लिए एक भी बूंद नहीं) वाक्यांश का क्या अर्थ है?",
      "question_gu": "વાક્યનો અર્થ શું છે 'પાણી, પાણી, સર્વત્ર, ન તો પીવા માટે કોઈ ટીપું'?",
      "options": [
        "It was raining heavily on the ship.",
        "The ship was sinking in the water.",
        "The ship was surrounded by a vast ocean of water, but they were dying of thirst because sea water is salty and undrinkable.",
        "They forgot to bring water bottles."
      ],
      "options_hi": [
        "जहाज पर भारी बारिश हो रही थी।",
        "जहाज पानी में डूब रहा था।",
